<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Brothers: He’s Son of righteousness,</l><l>Sisters: Hope, peace, and faith,</l><l>Brothers: The Lamb of God is He,</l><l>All: So call on Him now, don’t you wait.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Sisters: You say He’s Son of God,</l><l>Brothers: And Son of Man,</l><l>Sisters: Firstborn among the dead,</l><l>All: Firstborn of creation, AMEN!</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Brothers: Our Lord’s the great I AM,</l><l>Sisters: The start, the end.</l><l>Brothers: Alpha, Omega,</l><l>All: Lord Jesus, come quickly, AMEN!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
